/target
**/*.rs.bk

# Local editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Agent tooling never belongs in this repo
.claude/
.codex/
.agents/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

# Container-local cargo cache
/.cargo-home

# Backup artefacts from patch tools
*.orig
*.rej

# Built design canvas — regenerate from docs/design/ sources
/docs/design/*.canvas.html

# Rendered review frames. Regenerated by `make shot` on every run, so keeping
# them under version control adds tens of megabytes per regeneration. CI
# publishes them as build artifacts, and docs/references/ is what review
# compares against.
/docs/shots/

# Standup reports written by the collector thread. Working notes about
# building the project, not part of it.
/.standup/
